{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/catterick-training-area-firing-and-activity-forecast","content_id":"b8257131-06b2-492e-8be8-37bc6b3135af","description":"Annual firing schedule for Battle Hill, Bellerby, Feldom and Wathgill Ranges.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9577702","isbn":"","title":"Catterick Training Area firing forecast for October 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/catterick-training-area-firing-and-activity-forecast/catterick-training-area-firing-forecast-for-december-2025"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9577703","isbn":"","title":"Catterick Training Area firing forecast for November 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/catterick-training-area-firing-and-activity-forecast/catterick-training-area-firing-forecast-for-january-2026"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Public access to the ranges is permitted on specified tarmac roads, public footpaths and bridleways only when no red flags or red lights are displayed, and outside the scheduled firing times. Public access is governed by the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/north-yorkshire-byelaws\">Catterick Training Area byelaws</a>.</p>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>Do not enter the danger area when the range is in use, this is a danger to life. If ‘red flags’ or lights are hoisted, regardless of the timings, do not enter the training area. Learn more about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/safe-access\">accessing MOD training areas safely</a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h3>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/firing-notice\">UK military firing times for all ranges</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/public-access-to-military-areas\">Public access to military areas</a></p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added Catterick November firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-30T16:27:29Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick October firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-24T16:46:00Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick September firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-28T13:55:50Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick August firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T12:49:25Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick July firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-25T15:57:21Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick June firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:29:27Z"},{"note":"Deleted Catterick March firing times and added May.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-30T12:42:04Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick April firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:59:20Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick March firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-19T15:28:25Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick February firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-30T12:50:20Z"},{"note":"Deleted Catterick November firing times and added January 2026.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-18T16:51:29Z"},{"note":"Deleted Catterick October firing times and added December.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-18T15:23:00Z"},{"note":"Deleted September firing times for Catterick and added November.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-22T16:25:03Z"},{"note":"Deleted Catterick August firing times and added October firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-26T14:45:46Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick September firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-20T13:21:48Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick firing times for August. Added Catterick August firing times in HTML.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-08T10:26:08Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick July firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-06-20T16:05:05Z"},{"note":"Catterick June firing times updated.","public_timestamp":"2025-05-22T15:53:44Z"},{"note":"Added Catterick May firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-15T15:23:01Z"},{"n